  "description": "Universal file viewer for Lumeo — detects file type from MIME / extension and renders inline: PDF (via Lumeo.PdfViewer), images, video, audio, Markdown, JSON, CSV, source code (via Lumeo.CodeEditor) and plain text. Pluggable renderer registry; auth-aware via configurable HttpClient. Unknown types fall back to a Download CTA.",
